      "text": "NOW: Kilusang Bayan Kontra Kurakot (KBKK) coalition holds press briefing for the upcoming ‘Protestang Bayan Kontra Kurakot’ anti-corruption protest on November 30 in Luneta, Manila. \n\nThe group plans to organize another massive protest to call for accountability from corrupt government officials. They point to Pres. Marcos Jr. and VP Sara Duterte as chief culprits in corruption scandals ranging from confidential funds to flood control projects. \n\nKBKK invites the public to join the November 30 protest in Luneta and continue the call for systemic change.",
